MERIDIAN @PROJECT_VERSION@ - SOURCE CODE
==========================

Meridian is free software under the GNU Affero General Public License,
version 3 (LICENSE.txt). You can get the complete source code of this
build, and build it yourself, from:

  https://github.com/oziomaugochukwu78-ux/Meridian

This build was made from commit:

  @MERIDIAN_SOURCE_COMMIT@

To get exactly that version:

  git clone https://github.com/oziomaugochukwu78-ux/Meridian
  git -C Meridian checkout @MERIDIAN_SOURCE_COMMIT@

The README explains how to build it. The libraries inside Meridian, and
their licences, are listed in the licenses folder.
